From eec287f0a00a600f37fc9b07bca6cbe9a9fca736 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erik Larsson <who+github@cnackers.org>
Date: Thu, 30 Apr 2026 20:15:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tsskey: replace asn1crypto with stdlib base64 and DER helpers

Replace the asn1crypto dependency with stdlib base64 for PEM handling
and minimal pure-Python DER encode/decode helpers for the ASN.1
TSSPrivKey structure.

Due to tpm2-openssl and tpm2-tss-engine encoding booleans incorrectly,
accept any non-zero BOOLEAN value as True when decoding.

Signed-off-by: Erik Larsson <who+github@cnackers.org>
Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
